  _caller: {fileID: 2081114746}
  _content: "Somnolent Serum\r\nEffect: Puts the drinker into a deep sleep upon ingestion.\r\nDuration:
    5 minutes.\r\nColor: Blue.\r\n\r\nNightmare Nectar\r\nEffect: Induces a hallucinatory
    state that causes fear and panic.\r\nDuration: 2 minutes.\r\nColor: Red.\r\n\r\nZephyr
    Zing Elixir\r\nEffect: Greatly enhances the drinker\u2019s speed and reflexes.\r\nDuration:
    30 seconds.\r\nColor: Green."
